menuconfig SYSTEMCMDS_CAN_LOOPBACK_TEST
	bool "can_loopback_test"
	default n
	---help---
		Self-contained FDCAN loopback test.  Requires a physical jumper
		between the two CAN ports (CAN1_H<->CAN2_H, CAN1_L<->CAN2_L) and
		that uavcan is stopped before running.

		Sends test frames on FDCAN1 and verifies reception on FDCAN2 and
		vice versa, exercising both transceivers end-to-end without any
		external hardware.
